4PAXkp-oHZcQ7kNvwHlsvtM&_nc_oc=AdqY8IR8eMoPV_0G30I2n0piiF8-Wb9Rq_nrFhuwhR47ojkRTCaFvSYlu3x-6jVwklk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDH2JDbaoqSLkLLx6TZtwpQzG7b_gO8LPtcHvzkLZmsw&oe=6AE74937"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ckFSH1Z5S9kQ7kNvwEihdaz&_nc_oc=Adps80aA2OV-A36Hgp2GWhhqsCkVEs10Io86mAcOAVuS7WPzXIMmYq-6l4vA3x6JkbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTrRZbZXNxg6WNwdfIzV60uQQ7ISDqr3lWWtLIxMHWeDw&oe=6AE74ACA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A02-nbBFxCAQ7kNvwE4ifrS&_nc_oc=AdqqYOSy-MSMIDcWnM-JcsOJcxZzIwNBMhhV_Ba9WeG6M9LW68Wp86iWmGk6XTYAAGM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTWKKa4sWZ0FfmjkEwgYn-6mkoxXz0C9K0JG5-iWYGcPw&oe=6AE7702F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tq8D_0aVXF8Q7kNvwFEJ94Z&_nc_oc=Adr6d94TyrAyVBY0i652v7hXt2vHcPwLRA9uNZJiBGXryzbGTLSpuYcRQuKOPe9wv_E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2b2byEKUfXorNhO-0DQYumBGAii4-ObPO-2UVO7O8HQ&oe=6AE75983"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcOWNMZpoYEQ7kNvwGqWnqW&_nc_oc=Adq0Dwo4Yof5kYosBuXjwx3pUOyYNYQTYQbMlMy3gojYb6rpGybYM-w4_rXLINm6hks&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRyS9CQ_xPtWsfmlcv24yVkFTt1jofJ0mLL6tbJ9sEfnQ&oe=6AE751D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HP9N2YjZamkQ7kNvwGJfKRh&_nc_oc=AdrHxpjEZWGatfa5HAX5O4pL_QbgK5Lp5HK52DWgyRYKD-QiVOpxVkJronrKznj4wT8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSczT9Dph5LygEhDenYGQnMpQlb0gresXIIjXUsRKsB-Q&oe=6AE764FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080